# Normalise line endings so the working copy matches the repository and CI on
# every platform. Without this file, a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true
# materialises CRLF and `bun run format:check` fails on files the Linux CI
# considers correctly formatted: 47 false positives the first time it happened.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: git must never normalise their contents.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
